sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant View as Section View (Today/Fixtures/Standings/…)
    participant VM as Section ViewModel
    participant Repo as DataRepository
    participant Mem as MemoryStore (session + last-known-good)
    participant Disk as CacheStore (disk, TTL)
    participant Net as FPL / ESPN public APIs
    participant State as AppState
    participant Sched as AutoRefreshScheduler

    Note over View,Net: Fetch chain — see docs/system_design.md §3.2

    View->>VM: .task(id: refreshNonce) → load()
    VM->>Mem: seed from lastGoodFixturesSnapshot() (instant, .stale)
    VM->>Repo: matches()

    Repo->>Mem: cachedFixtures() (session cache)
    alt session hit
        Mem-->>Repo: [Match] → (.live)
    else miss
        Repo->>Disk: get(key, ttl = 5 min)
        alt disk hit
            Disk-->>Repo: [Match] → (.live)
        else miss / TTL expired
            Repo->>Net: FPL fixtures (→ ESPN scoreboard fallback), 20 s budget
            alt network success
                Net-->>Repo: [Match]
                Repo->>Disk: set(key, value)
                Repo->>Mem: cacheFixtures + rememberFixtures (last-known-good)
                Repo-->>VM: ([Match], .live)
            else network failed / timed out
                Repo->>Disk: getStale(key) → (.stale)
                Repo->>Mem: lastGoodFixturesSnapshot() → (.stale)
                Note over Repo: only a process that never fetched successfully yields empty
            end
        end
    end
    Repo-->>VM: ([Match], DataSource)
    VM-->>View: render (previous data stays on screen while revalidating)

    Note over VM,Repo: standings / scorers / assists / injuries run the same chain<br/>(bootstrap slots + ESPN v3 records → fixture aggregation tiers)

    View->>State: reportLiveSchedule(matches)
    State->>Sched: refreshInterval(schedule, now)
    alt live match or global auto-refresh
        Sched-->>State: 60 s poll (fixtures only, scoresOnly)
    else idle
        Sched-->>State: sleep until kickoff − 15 min (6 h cap)
    end
    State->>State: refreshTick → refresh(scoresOnly) → nonce += 1 → views reload silently
